    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As part of preparing this plan, you must have been able to be near the chosen area for at least 10 minutes. When you reveal this plan, you immediately dredge an area that you can see, selecting an amount of squares as if you had dredged as a full-round action, lasting for 1 round per rank in the associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/survivalism#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
